    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "线性系统对输入 x 的常数倍 β 的响应，必须等于该输入对应响应乘以相同常数，使得输出等于 β y(t)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The response of a linear system to a constant multiple β of an input x must be equal to the response to the input multiplied by the same constant so that the output is equal to β y(t).",
